                                                "text": "I've lost my pen! —Here mate, borrow mine. —You legend."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa43486c-e85e-339a-ac55-8232b9b23b46",
                                        "entry_id": "04d63f5b-243d-33c8-ba2f-978ac5fbae6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A key to the symbols and color codes on a map, chart, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc08c073-de36-4195-8f83-c29a023ae020",
                                                "sense_id": "aa43486c-e85e-339a-ac55-8232b9b23b46",
                                                "text": "According to the legend on the map, that building is a school."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e247722-64a6-3e09-a558-5fbce212d0fc",
                                        "entry_id": "04d63f5b-243d-33c8-ba2f-978ac5fbae6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inscription, motto, or title, especially one surrounding the field in a medal or coin, or placed upon a heraldic shield or beneath an engraving or illustration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54f1570e-9a33-490f-bb83-46624f8551da",
                                                "sense_id": "3e247722-64a6-3e09-a558-5fbce212d0fc",
                                                "text": "Further clues are provided by milk-floats bearing the legend 'Lord Rayleigh's Dairies: A Family Business', and a number of signs indicating the whereabouts of various departments of Lord Rayleigh's Farms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fb8c267-3bf2-4459-8e66-065e3a325bc2",
                                                "sense_id": "3e247722-64a6-3e09-a558-5fbce212d0fc",
                                                "text": "[…]there were three small brass coins there, the gift of Ymar. Their legends, like their faces, had worn away; and they were dark with verdigris — in appearance precisely the ancient things they were."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
